1\":0,\"xref\":\"x\",\"y0\":0,\"y1\":1,\"yref\":\"y domain\"}],\"height\":400,\"hovermode\":\"closest\",\"xaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"offense edge vs league (pts\\u002f100)\"}},\"yaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"defense edge vs league (pts\\u002f100)\"}}},                        {\"displaylogo\": false, \"responsive\": true}                    )                };                            </script>        </div>\n```\n\n\n**How NBA champions' shots differed from the league** (percentage points; + = more of that shot than the league)\n\n| era     |   champions |   threes |   rim |   mid-range |   assisted makes |\n|:--------|------------:|---------:|------:|------------:|-----------------:|\n| 2004-10 |           7 |      1   |   0.2 |        -1.2 |              1   |\n| 2011-16 |           6 |      2.9 |  -0.9 |        -2   |              2.4 |\n| 2017-21 |           5 |      1   |   0.2 |        -1.2 |              3.9 |\n| 2022-26 |           5 |      2.3 |  -0.7 |        -1.6 |              1.4 |\n\n\n**NBA champions' archetype minutes minus the league average** (percentage points)\n\n| era     | identity mix                             |   Connector forward |   Hub big / point forward |   On-ball creator |   Rim-running big |   Secondary guard |   Spot-up 3-and-D wing |\n|:--------|:-----------------------------------------|--------------------:|--------------------------:|------------------:|------------------:|------------------:|-----------------------:|\n| 2004-10 | defense-led 4, balanced 3                |                -3.4 |                       0.8 |               3.6 |              -1.1 |              -4.4 |                    4.5 |\n| 2011-16 | balanced 5, offense-led 1                |                -6.3 |                      -3.8 |               0.5 |               0.8 |               2.4 |                    6.4 |\n| 2017-21 | balanced 3, offense-led 2                |                -3.5 |                       3.1 |              -2.1 |              -0.2 |              -2.9 |                    5.7 |\n| 2022-26 | balanced 3, defense-led 1, offense-led 1 |                -0.6 |                      -2   |              -1.6 |              -2.2 |               0.4 |                    6   |\n\n\n**Share of NBA champions with each ingredient** (loose definitions, meant to show drift)\n\n| era     |   primary scorer |   secondary scorer |   spacing big |   perimeter defender |   high-usage players |\n|:--------|-----------------:|-------------------:|--------------:|---------------------:|---------------------:|\n| 2004-10 |                1 |               0.86 |          0.57 |                 1    |                 1.71 |\n| 2011-16 |                1 |               1    |          0.5  |                 0.83 |                 1.83 |\n| 2017-21 |                1 |               1    |          0.2  |                 0.8  |                 1.8  |\n| 2022-26 |                1 |               1    |          0.6  |                 0.8  |                 2    |\n\n\n\n## NBA: picking champions\n\nForward-chained over NBA seasons: each season predicted from earlier NBA seasons only.\n\n\n| model                                            |   avg prob. on champion |   log-lik (higher is better) |\n|:-------------------------------------------------|------------------------:|-----------------------------:|\n| net rating only                                  |                   0.152 |                       -2.058 |\n| net + checklist                                  |                   0.161 |                       -2.083 |\n| net + roster mix                                 |                   0.14  |                       -2.259 |\n| net + roster mix + over-use terms                |                   0.143 |                       -2.294 |\n| archetype mix                                    |                   0.072 |                       -2.81  |\n| player quality (efficiency vs role, stars)       |                   0.076 |                       -2.628 |\n| mix + quality                                    |                   0.076 |                       -2.741 |\n| mix + quality + stats (age, shot diet, defense)  |                   0.105 |                       -2.565 |\n| playoff-available roster: mix + quality + stats  |                   0.112 |                       -2.438 |\n| two-stage: composition -> predicted net -> title |                   0.092 |                       -2.434 |\n\n\n\n# WNBA (2009 to 2026)\n\n## WNBA: which shots survive the playoffs?\n\n\n```{=html}\n<div>                            <div id=\"8c61c8f1-e633-442a-b6ac-ad0315487a3c\" class=\"plotly-graph-div\" style=\"height:360px; width:100%;\"></div>            <script type=\"text/javascript\">                                    window.PLOTLYENV=window.PLOTLYENV || {};                                    if (document.getElementById(\"8c61c8f1-e633-442a-b6ac-ad0315487a3c\")) {                    Plotly.newPlot(                        \"8c61c8f1-e633-442a-b6ac-ad0315487a3c\",                        [{\"hovertemplate\":\"three: %{y:+.3f}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u002fextra\\u003e\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"#2a78d6\",\"width\":2},\"marker\":{\"color\":\"#2a78d6\",\"size\":6},\"mode\":\"lines+markers\",\"name\":\"three\",\"x\":[2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026],\"y\":[0.0877157106923842,0.1028721132322543,-0.015088909798125,-0.0955045029946458,-0.2507562364235807,-0.0407365322688848,0.0961516407329216,-0.0437941214221537,0.0094578743254118,-0.0472696953994337,0.0561188581919918,-0.0171836710298247,0.0026976079838623,0.0050215743206605,0.0032299849627541,0.0246435962510893,-0.0495595314736491,-0.0226498102443859],\"type\":\"scatter\"},{\"hovertemplate\":\"rim: %{y:+.3f}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u002fextra\\u003e\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"#eb6834\",\"width\":2},\"marker\":{\"color\":\"#eb6834\",\"size\":6},\"mode\":\"lines+markers\",\"nam